# §22.5 #4a combat-mage-confusion-hold: two flag-mutating casts in one
# fixture. The §22.5 plan groups confusion + hold + antimagic into one
# trio fixture, but slot 1 mage's ma cap (= wi = 67 at lv 1) only fits
# two of the three casts (cost 18 + 44 = 62; antimagic adds another 29
# which exceeds the cap). Antimagic gets its own one-cast fixture so
# the set still covers battle_flag for confused / held / antimagic / ws
# and the shared battle.spell.utters_word + family-specific text shards.
RYL_FAKE_EPOCH=1700000000
RYL_FAKE_SEED=2
RYL_NO_DELAY=1
RYL_FORCE_ENCOUNTER=wild_dog
RYL_FORCE_ENCOUNTER_NOC=2
